  "scoring_key_verified": false,
  "notes": "Two passes on the same screen per row: 'now' (how it is) and 'ideal' (how I would like it), 1 = I do it all, 5 = shared equally, 9 = partner does it all (the app is gender-neutral; the original scale runs from all-her to all-him). Rows 1–16 household tasks, 17–20 decisions, 21–24 childcare; childcare rows route to the parenting domain. Per person: now-versus-ideal gap per row (derived). Couple-level: disagreement between the two 'now' ratings after mirroring the partner's perspective. The row list is a placeholder pending the official Who Does What? task list (distributed on request, see docs/instrument_acquisition.md); the RDAS consensus items on household tasks can stand in temporarily.",
  "pass_prompts": {
    "now": "How it is now",
    "ideal": "How I would like it"
  }
}
